// `null` is reserved: it is no value in kama (an `fnptr` and every handle are non-null, and a maybe is an `Optional`), and
// it names nothing either. tree-sitter refuses it at the declaration as the compiler does (KR-29); before, the editor
// grammar showed this file clean.
fn uint8 main()
{
    isize null = 1;
    return 0;
}
